description:
Implement `useHeadlessAccordion` — a headless accordion hook with ARIA support. When `allowMultiple` is false, opening one item closes the others.

**Example:**
```tsx
function Accordion() {
  const { getHeaderProps, getPanelProps, isExpanded, toggle } =
    useHeadlessAccordion(['Section 1', 'Section 2', 'Section 3']);

  return (
    <div>
      {['Section 1', 'Section 2', 'Section 3'].map(item => (
        <div key={item}>
          <button {...getHeaderProps(item)}>{item}</button>
          {isExpanded(item) && <div {...getPanelProps(item)}>Content</div>}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  );
}
```

